{"3679610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Velthos", "steam_appid": 3679610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velthos is a 2D top-down roguelite action game where survival is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight relentless enemies, uncover hidden puzzles, and prepare for encounters with powerful bosses within a cursed realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run challenges you to balance fast-paced combat mastery with strategic decision-making. As waves of enemies grow stronger, you must uncover secret mechanics, solve puzzle-like objectives, and push deeper into danger to face the threats that await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is never guaranteed — only earned through skill, adaptation, and smart build choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velthos is a 2D top-down roguelite action game where survival is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight relentless enemies, uncover hidden puzzles, and prepare for encounters with powerful bosses within a cursed realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run challenges you to balance fast-paced combat mastery with strategic decision-making. As waves of enemies grow stronger, you must uncover secret mechanics, solve puzzle-like objectives, and push deeper into danger to face the threats that await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is never guaranteed — only earned through skill, adaptation, and smart build choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Battle endless hordes, solve deadly puzzles, and summon powerful bosses in this fast-paced 2D roguelite action game.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Dutch, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic